d.statements.targetStatement='Harbor Ridge Mutual is a place where people tell the truth early, try small things and say when a result looks wrong, because the members who own us rely on our judgment. We use AI to help people do their work, and a named person always answers for what it decides. We tell employees in writing what AI will change for them before it arrives. We keep our promise that no one is penalized for raising a concern in good faith.';
