function culRsPriCountLine(){var n=culRsPriCount();return (n===0?'No priority dimensions chosen.':n===1?'1 priority dimension chosen.':n+' priority dimensions chosen.')+' Choose three to five.'}
function culTgtTrack(d,ro){var P=function(v){return ((Math.max(1,Math.min(5,v))-1)/4*100).toFixed(2)+'%'},b=d.base,l=d.latest,t=d.target,hi=l!=null?l:b,i,h='<div class="cmap-ttrack" aria-hidden="true"'+(ro?'':' title="Click to set the target here" onclick="'+escAttr("culTgtClick(event,'"+d.id+"')")+'"')+'><span class="ln"></span>'; /* ro: read-only, as in step 4.3's review */
  for(i=1;i<=5;i++)h+='<span class="tk" style="left:'+P(i)+'"></span>';
  if(hi!=null&&t!=null)h+='<span class="gp" style="left:'+P(Math.min(hi,t))+';width:calc('+P(Math.max(hi,t))+' - '+P(Math.min(hi,t))+')"></span>';
  if(b!=null&&hi!=null&&hi>b)h+='<span class="pg" style="left:'+P(b)+';width:calc('+P(hi)+' - '+P(b)+')"></span>';
  if(b!=null)h+='<span class="b" style="left:'+P(b)+'"></span>';
  if(l!=null)h+='<span class="l" style="left:'+P(l)+'"></span>';
  if(t!=null)h+='<span class="t" style="left:'+P(t)+'"></span>';
  return h+'</div>'} /* drawn in HTML so its dots stay round at any width; the number beside it is the keyboard's way in */
function culTgtClick(ev,rowId){try{var el=ev.currentTarget||ev.target;while(el&&!(el.classList&&el.classList.contains('cmap-ttrack')))el=el.parentNode;if(!el)return;var r=el.getBoundingClientRect();if(!r.width)return;var v=Math.round((1+(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*4)*10)/10;v=Math.max(1,Math.min(5,v));culTgtSet(rowId,String(v),'')}catch(e){}}
