  h+='<div class="cul-ck-h">How you will know it is being done</div>'+fhelp('A measure counts something that happens and leaves a record, such as concerns answered in writing within ten working days. It does not count how people feel. The questionnaire does that. Add as many measures as the clause needs, each with a target per quarter.');
