  stepIntro:"Make sure no team is asked to take on more change than it can absorb. Culture work competes with every other change for people\u2019s attention, so list every substantial change that will reach each team over the next two quarters, not only the culture work. Then estimate, team by team, how much of its capacity for change they will take up, and decide what to do where that is more than the team can absorb.",
