  what:{h:"One page, a card for each team.",b:"Each team has a card. On it you list the changes that will reach the team over the next two quarters, every kind of change and not only the culture work, weigh each one, and estimate how much of the team\u2019s capacity for change they will take up together. Where the estimate is above 100%, you say what the organization will do."},
