/* ── The agenda page (Batch 5, job 1.3), route 'cultureReview'. Page chrome copied from Architecture's renderDgReviewPage, dgItem, dgItemBody and dgAgendaBlock (Paul's ruling 7). Drawing creates nothing. ── */
