/* ═══ The Rewiring Charter document (Batch 3, step 2.3, job C2, 7 Oct 2026) ═══
   A standalone output built like the Baseline Report: parts that steps 2.3, 2.4 and 2.5 each add to CUL_CHARTER_PARTS as {key, html()}, printed in the fixed order of CUL_CHARTER_ORDER whatever order they were added in. It opens with the Target Culture (culTargetCharterOpening). A part returns '' until its step has entries, and prints no empty heading and no step number. */
