   "body": "Copy each statement word for word, even where it sounds dated or overstated. The aim is to capture what the organization claims, so that the rest of Phase 1 can test those claims against what actually happens. When you list the AI in use, treat the official list as a starting point. Ask team leads what their teams use, and look for tools that people pay for themselves or have adopted without approval.",
   "example": "A claims team may use a free online chatbot to summarize case notes without anyone having approved it. Record it as an unofficial AI use. If you leave it out, the baseline will show less AI in use than people actually rely on, and you will have nothing to set against what employees later say about the AI tools they use without approval."
